@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Refuse `task: distill` with `modality: vision` or `audio` at config load instead
+of silently running text-only distillation, in both token and sequence modes.
+The error names the unsupported modality and the text-only alternative;
+`soup doctor --config` also rejects the configuration. This addresses item 1
+of #1186 only, not the separate SFT/unsloth modality combination.
